Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.84,0:00:08.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是料亭的少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.21,0:00:11.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沟口特制炒饭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.59,0:00:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沟口特制
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.43,0:00:17.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着好不靠谱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特蕾莎修女也说过
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.76,0:00:23.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最重要的不是做了多少事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是付出了多少心思
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:27.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的心思花在我们身上也白搭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.94,0:00:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说那个特蕾莎去哪了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.74,0:00:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笑点好低
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.49,0:00:39.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总而言之 各位新队员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.53,0:00:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等会再自我介绍 先开吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.67,0:00:50.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 米饭颗粒分明
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没吃过这么好吃的炒饭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.34,0:00:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:19.22,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}结束漫不经心度过的每一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:23.39,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}满心想要脱离现状
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:29.07,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我总是不敢踏出第一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.23,0:01:33.20,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}每次是你牵着我的手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:39.04,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}带我去看新的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.37,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界变幻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:43.50,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}迈出最初一步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.50,0:01:46.71,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}仿佛带来了变化
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:52.63,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不再担心 我们在一起能去到任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.76,0:01:54.22,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.30,0:01:55.76,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}以最本真的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:58.97,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}虽然也有不安也有迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:05.65,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}但有太多事情 不试试没法知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:07.19,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}去吧 飞翔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:12.15,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}伸手仿佛能触碰天空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:15.28,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}我们不再孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:20.45,OP_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}投身新世界
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:19.22,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}何気なく過ごしてる　日々に蓋してしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.56,0:01:23.39,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}抜け出したい気持ちは山々です
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:29.07,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目が　踏み出せない僕に
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.23,0:01:33.20,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}いつでも君が僕の手引っ張って
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:39.04,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しいモノを見に　連れて行ってくれる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.16,0:01:41.37,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}世界が変わる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.54,0:01:43.50,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}初めの一歩目で
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.50,0:01:46.71,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}変われた気がした
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.92,0:01:52.63,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}とこまでても行ける　もう大丈夫僕らなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.76,0:01:54.22,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.30,0:01:55.76,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}ありのままで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:58.97,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}不安も迷いもあるけれど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:05.65,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}やってみなきゃわからない　事がたくさんあるんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.77,0:02:07.19,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}行け、飛べ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:12.15,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}あのそらに届きそうなぐらいに手を伸ばす
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:15.28,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}僕らはもう一人じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.45,0:02:20.45,OP_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\blur4}新しい世界に飛び込むのさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.81,0:02:33.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是三年级的金田保 请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.73,0:02:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是二年级的染谷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.44,0:02:38.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二年级的乘田
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.65,0:02:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的外号就叫金 银 铜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.20,0:02:48.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,入部理由我大概明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.83,0:02:50.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是一年级的安藤武
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这支队伍是学园祭上最出风头的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.50,0:02:55.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我也想参加
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.50,0:02:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就叫爱出风头的西兰花
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.63,0:02:59.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太长了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:00.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就叫阿武吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.99,0:03:10.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是三年级的锅岛卓哉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.95,0:03:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是他的弟弟 一年级的卓巳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.16,0:03:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和哥哥一起看了学园祭表演
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.50,0:03:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:20.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明叫BREAKERS却没有跳BREAK
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.67,0:03:23.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这有啥可笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:26.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这俩人是底座的好材料
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.68,0:03:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是在第一排看学园祭表演的？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.93,0:03:35.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到我啦 真开心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:40.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 你的名字是...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.03,0:03:45.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是一年级的佐久间 叫我佐久就好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小时候是{\u1}芭蕾舞者{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:52.08,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(745.333,620)}ballerina
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.08,0:03:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ballerina指的是女舞者吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么佐久 你的名是？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.25,0:04:03.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙造
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龙造？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:09.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.39,0:04:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是一年级的森尚史
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时去看DREAMS的表演了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.68,0:04:17.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以没能看到BREAKBRS的演出
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.94,0:04:20.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过既然是全男生的队伍
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.44,0:04:23.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那肯定很有气势吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比阳明大学SPARER的气势更强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.49,0:04:27.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妥妥的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.99,0:04:30.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 真厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.74,0:04:35.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很期待训练 请多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.83,0:04:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后是我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:45.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是从今天起担任BREAKERS专属教练的高城
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:47.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先把话放在前头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:50.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学园祭的表演就啦啦队而言根本不合格
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.51,0:04:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子摇摇晃晃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.85,0:04:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底座和后点也根本没尽到应有的职责
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.77,0:05:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们只是在用蛮力抛接尖子而已
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.52,0:05:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就和庆祝时的抛人没两样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.77,0:05:05.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的水平太次了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:07.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:08.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,次了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.95,0:05:11.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我决定当你们的教练
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.37,0:05:16.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没异议吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.33,0:05:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.16,0:05:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有异议 大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.25,0:05:23.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请叫我教练
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:26.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎 队员变多了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.59,0:05:30.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且看起来都是些很有个性的人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:33.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一 你事先知道高城要来当教练吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道啊 她突然说要来参加今天的聚会
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.18,0:05:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到能有专属教练
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.69,0:05:41.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.02,0:05:43.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.15,0:05:46.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桥本
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:48.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:50.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加我进交流群
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.32,0:05:52.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.49,0:05:53.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.58,0:05:58.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 等会要去打工是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.54,0:06:06.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这位是今天新来的德川
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.00,0:06:08.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:10.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让您久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请慢用
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:19.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么也到这里来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我先前撒了谎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是真的来打工 那就不是撒谎了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.08,0:06:27.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且人数一多 总有要花钱的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.25,0:06:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.09,0:06:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.05,0:06:35.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不愿意高城当我们的教练...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.89,0:06:37.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.01,0:06:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要想不被批评做动作像抛人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.30,0:06:43.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们确实需要一个正规的指导者
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.77,0:06:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什么 这是我儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.40,0:06:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原本计划下半学期来留学的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到晚了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.23,0:06:54.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.90,0:06:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.61,0:06:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是一口别扭的京都腔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.57,0:07:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请大家多多指导他的日语
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.45,0:07:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里 我们还想向他请教中文呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.79,0:07:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧 阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.75,0:07:08.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是那个新入部的...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.05,0:07:15.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.76,0:07:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尚史
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.39,0:07:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.01,0:07:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.35,0:07:24.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 我们已经是前辈了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.27,0:07:26.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想问啥随便问
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.68,0:07:28.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括怎么才能受女生欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:31.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是...我不擅长应付女生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.40,0:07:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你是基佬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.94,0:07:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才加入男子啦啦队啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.49,0:07:37.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.95,0:07:40.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高城教练说今天稍晚些
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.78,0:07:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放学园祭表演录像给大家看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.66,0:07:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚收到消息了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.12,0:07:49.37,左上记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(291.142,449.715)}今天开学园祭的反省会。\N你们有表演我录下来了。\N做好谁备啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:51.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么还有爱心...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是OG啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.85,0:08:06.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OG?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.10,0:08:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「额头凸起」的简略
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.31,0:08:10.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.35,0:08:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说啥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.56,0:08:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥都没说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.94,0:08:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,额头凸起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水平不过尔尔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.74,0:08:23.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和DREAMS没法比 跟别提SPARKS了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.66,0:08:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 压根比不了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:32.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我能看出来 你们这些外行已经竭尽全力去思考
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:34.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也拼命地训练过了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然 技术层面上比DREAMS差得太远
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.26,0:08:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过技术只要多练谁都能掌握
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.05,0:08:44.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换个说法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAKERS很快就能超过DREAMS
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让你们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.02,0:08:57.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站上这个舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.41,0:09:07.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全国锦标赛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.99,0:09:10.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三月底在尾张举办
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.29,0:09:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,DREAMS也是每年参赛 并且能进入前三名
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.38,0:09:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果不能在一月底进行的预赛中
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.80,0:09:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做出超过基准分的表演
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:23.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就得不到出场资格
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.80,0:09:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一月
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.22,0:09:27.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有三个多月
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.24,0:09:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这么短的时间里超过基准分 这办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.12,0:09:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.46,0:09:35.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐久
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.67,0:09:37.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学园祭的表演非常棒
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.25,0:09:39.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以肯定能做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.63,0:09:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么还没尝试 阿森就说做不到呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.72,0:09:45.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.22,0:09:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就是超过基准分么
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.47,0:09:49.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 一定要超过
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.14,0:09:51.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会追随你的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.39,0:09:52.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.52,0:09:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也得加油
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:54.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.39,0:09:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要出尽风头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练 拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.65,0:10:04.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 想参加锦标赛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就必须提升技能
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.41,0:10:08.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.91,0:10:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一上来就直呼其名啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.41,0:10:12.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当队长
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.08,0:10:14.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有翔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.29,0:10:20.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当教头 负责带新队员
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.26,0:10:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:34.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猪排咖喱乌冬饭三拼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.52,0:10:36.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说你跟来做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.89,0:10:39.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来学实用日语啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.77,0:10:40.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好辣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.73,0:10:43.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.61,0:10:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桥本队长真好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.16,0:10:49.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我阿一吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.16,0:10:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:54.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么像个gal似的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.12,0:10:56.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不说这个词了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:56.87,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,注：gal：ギャル，姑娘，少女，辣妹
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.83,0:10:59.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全国锦标赛吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:01.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标一下子变高了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.63,0:11:06.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高城教练说每周二和周五来指导我们训练
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.05,0:11:09.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候得确保体育馆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.76,0:11:13.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周一周三就去阿晴家楼顶训练
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:14.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:18.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周六周日有人得去打工 就自己训练吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.44,0:11:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有周四没安排
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.56,0:11:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如永生一般拥有梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.19,0:11:26.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今日就将死去一般活着
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.95,0:11:28.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,詹姆斯·迪恩说的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:31.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这话正适合现在的我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.82,0:11:33.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须带着「今天是正式演出
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.20,0:11:36.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过了今天没明天」的想法拼命练
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:40.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部员也增加了咱们也得加把劲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:42.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好嘞 赶紧吃完回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.50,0:11:43.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.55,0:11:49.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.18,0:11:56.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天走那边回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.39,0:11:58.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为啥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.60,0:11:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.81,0:12:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走那边去车站会绕路啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.23,0:12:04.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺便消消食
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.07,0:12:06.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.11,0:12:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.54,0:12:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先借用了你家浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.51,0:12:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秋季四边形
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.38,0:12:31.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.47,0:12:34.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直都在顾及我的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没察觉到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:39.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前你都特意错开了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们和柔道部的人去食堂的时间吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.33,0:12:46.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家店铺面又不大
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.75,0:12:49.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柔道部在的话就没地方坐了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:51.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是惭愧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.88,0:12:54.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一一直在照顾我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.01,0:12:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你跟我一起来了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.59,0:12:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说要成立啦啦队的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.14,0:13:04.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要参加全国锦标赛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.43,0:13:09.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样一来 柔道部那些人肯定就...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.85,0:13:11.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴子就能理解你了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.08,0:13:25.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先锻炼躯干
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.71,0:13:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是男人就忍住 咬牙坚持
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.47,0:13:41.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.72,0:13:47.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...是 大哥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.93,0:13:49.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用太勉强
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.89,0:13:51.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要维持正确的姿势
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.65,0:13:53.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢练 渐渐就能保持住了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.06,0:13:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢前辈
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.78,0:14:02.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.53,0:14:06.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃...安藤
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.58,0:14:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我武就行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.04,0:14:11.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要恶作剧 很容易受伤的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.12,0:14:13.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥 别穿我的T恤啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.79,0:14:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的东西就是哥哥的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.42,0:14:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也常被人这么训
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.84,0:14:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坂东你也有哥哥啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我有个姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:26.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.68,0:14:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他指导得挺用心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:30.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么感觉那家伙变了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.64,0:14:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴是新队员的保姆
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.15,0:14:36.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真会照顾人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.48,0:14:38.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他向来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:44.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.62,0:14:47.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我有东西要交给各位
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:50.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反省用的笔记
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.00,0:14:54.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每天训练结束后
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.87,0:14:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把感想写在上面 什么感想都行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.75,0:14:59.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.46,0:15:00.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了直面白我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.59,0:15:05.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要坚持做一件事 以完成某个目标的话
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.59,0:15:06.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是最好的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一页我已经写下了每个人的课题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:27.00,上标,,0,0,0,,{\frz7.684\pos(633.143,362.857)}赢过阿一！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.41,0:15:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.45,0:15:34.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个...这是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.17,0:15:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴 你比不过阿一
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.54,0:15:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论柔韧性还是平衡性
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:44.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一都比你更胜一筹
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.97,0:15:49.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 你却好像没把阿一当成对手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.74,0:15:52.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己应该也明白
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:56.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有超越阿一 你才能进步
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.71,0:15:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 翔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周五前确定包括新成员在内所有人的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.05,0:16:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.01,0:16:07.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练 请允许我送您一程
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.34,0:16:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不必
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.18,0:16:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话说 翔的笔记本上写了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.68,0:16:15.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.02,0:16:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我在想位置的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.02,0:16:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.35,0:16:22.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去招待
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.11,0:16:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您想点什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.44,0:16:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我要卡布奇诺
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尖子是阿一 晴希 佐久
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,底座是阿远 一郎 尚史
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:38.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卓哉 卓巳 金 阿武
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.08,0:16:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后点是沟口 弦 银 铜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:45.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一共14个人 好像少了谁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.80,0:16:47.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,写这个的人自己没算进来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.22,0:16:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算逃避到几时
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.31,0:16:59.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你曾是个优秀的底座
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.73,0:17:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队伍是你支撑起来的 这毫无疑问
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.24,0:17:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.89,0:17:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 我突然跑出来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:38.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要吃点什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让大家操心了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.27,0:17:44.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家什么都没问我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.35,0:17:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都有不愿被问及的心事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.07,0:17:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一说的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.53,0:17:53.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能我也叫大家操心了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.99,0:17:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家明明是开道场的 我却放弃了柔道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:18:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都没问我为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:03.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然也有肩膀受伤的因素
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.67,0:18:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我总是比不赢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.63,0:18:10.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我姐很强 强到能得全国冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:13.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.84,0:18:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我高中是在阳明上的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:22.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那之前你当底座
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:24.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在阳明的SPARKS吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.48,0:18:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高城教练当时负责指导我们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.94,0:18:35.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高三夏天 最后的夏日杯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想要打造出全日本最精彩的2分30秒
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.87,0:18:44.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.79,0:18:50.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决赛里...把樱摔了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.75,0:18:52.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樱是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.03,0:19:01.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:06.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樱是我们队的王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活泼开朗 是所有人的支柱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:12.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:23.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樱摔伤了腰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.85,0:19:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 我会好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.64,0:19:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今后我会继续啦啦队运动
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔你也会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.11,0:19:36.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我啊 因为翔是底座
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.40,0:19:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以才敢尽情地起跳呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:44.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我...害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.66,0:19:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕自己当底座会不会再把谁摔下来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:53.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练说的没错 我一直在逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.59,0:19:55.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我很清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.21,0:19:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 我...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:00.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.05,0:20:01.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:04.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.40,0:20:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会努力 下次也一定要赢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:19.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也在逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.12,0:20:23.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:27.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教练那里我去说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:29.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,位置的事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.12,0:20:34.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就按原来的 你不用参加托举
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.46,0:20:36.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 虽然不清楚原因
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.21,0:20:37.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但不用强迫自己去做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:41.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翔就好好训练新队员吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.34,0:20:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然还有我们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.93,0:20:49.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 桥本
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.52,0:20:50.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.06,0:20:51.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:20:54.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀 坂东也在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.27,0:20:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说你们就一群男生在搞啦啦队？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:21:00.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,学园祭我看了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.36,0:21:02.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.07,0:21:05.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么着
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.54,0:21:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们确实是一群男生在搞啦啦队
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.63,0:21:15.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还准备参加比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:18.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标是全国锦标赛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.38,0:21:22.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是、是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:25.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们都好好努力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.68,0:21:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.64,0:21:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.60,0:21:29.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿晴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.16,0:21:31.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:34.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须正视自己
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.16,0:21:36.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想翔也一样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.29,0:21:40.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柔道是需要抛摔对手的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是被抛出去的人都会采取{\u1}受身{\u0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:43.42,注记,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32}注：受身又称“倒地法”。倒地法是在被对手摔倒或是自己倒地时的自我安全保护的法。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:46.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以只管抛不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:48.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最擅长受身了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.84,0:21:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿一也是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.10,0:21:58.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看 很熟练吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.11,0:22:01.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.48,0:22:05.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的意思是...根本不用害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.99,0:22:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,柔道和啦啦队是两码事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.03,0:22:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.03,0:22:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 阿晴的意思是...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.28,0:22:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信你 对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.16,0:22:26.28,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:27.91,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.37,0:22:29.53,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,JUST DO IT！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.62,0:22:32.29,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS！！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.77,0:22:38.06,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,不由自主地大声回应
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.23,0:22:41.65,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,崭新大门打开的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:44.73,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,就像紧紧握住的拳头
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.90,0:22:48.07,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,决意坚定地响起
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:51.53,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,想要散发的能量 一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.61,0:22:54.87,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话感觉能改变些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.95,0:22:57.83,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是在寻找
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.91,0:23:01.21,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,有趣的事情对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.42,0:23:04.67,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,没有自信＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.75,0:23:07.92,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,自暴自弃＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:09.80,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,那天的自己 不要输
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.88,0:23:11.39,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,送上应援的呼喊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.51,0:23:16.01,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,加油打气的动作＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:19.39,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,YES FLY HIGH FLY DIVE 起飞吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.52,0:23:23.02,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,垂头丧气抱怨「到极限了」＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.06,0:23:26.32,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT 打破极限＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.44,0:23:29.65,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向彼此微笑 流下汗水 SHOW YOUR GUTS GUTS＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.74,0:23:32.82,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着晴空＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:36.16,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,胜利的姿势＜高V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:39.33,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,连同心一起抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.41,0:23:43.12,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,向着邂逅闪耀笑容的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.21,0:23:46.04,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.17,0:23:50.67,ED_CN,NTP,0,0,0,,GO FIGHT GO FIGHT WIN！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.77,0:22:38.06,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,思わず大きな返事してたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.23,0:22:41.65,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,新しい扉ひらく声は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.77,0:22:44.73,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぎゅっと握ったこぶしみたいだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.90,0:22:48.07,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,頼もしそうに響く決意
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.36,0:22:51.53,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,弾けたいエネルギー　ずっと待ってたんだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.61,0:22:54.87,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ぶっちゃけたら何かを　変えられる気がして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.95,0:22:57.83,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,おもしろそうなこといつだって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.91,0:23:01.21,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,探してきたんだろ？そうだろ？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.42,0:23:04.67,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,自信なくて＜OH MY GOD！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.75,0:23:07.92,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,ふてくされてた＜OH MY PRIDE！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.96,0:23:09.80,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,あの日の自分＜負けるな！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.88,0:23:11.39,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,エールを＜おくろう！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.51,0:23:16.01,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,元気づけるモーション＜LET'S DANCE TOGETHER！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.14,0:23:19.39,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,YES！FLY HIGH FLY DIVE　とびだせ！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.52,0:23:23.02,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,「もう限界」なんてうなだれは＜NO！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.06,0:23:26.32,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,BREAK UP BREAK OUT　壊しちゃえばいい＜YES！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.44,0:23:29.65,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,笑いあって　汗をかいてSHOW YOUR GUTS！＜GUTS！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.74,0:23:32.82,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,青空へ＜JUMP！JUMP！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.95,0:23:36.16,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,勝利のポーズ＜HIGH V！＞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:39.33,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,心ごと掴め！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.41,0:23:43.12,ED_JP,NTP,0,0,0,,キラめく笑顔に出会える瞬間へ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.47,0:23:58.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,训练才刚开始吧 慢慢来嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.93,0:24:00.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还慢慢来 你是乌龟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 别侮辱乌龟 连乌龟都不如
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.52,0:24:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你个混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.77,0:24:07.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一集 扭曲
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.02,0:24:09.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,LET'S GO BREAKERS
